 "loot_doc": "Tier loot (Kit 2026-10-04), read by Fenia global/onDeath/drops tierLoot. Champion/boss/legend: the guaranteed part (items, recipe/scroll/component/cut/flawless rolls) drops once per player per mob vnum per cooldown_h real hours; inside the window the kill gets the ordinary drop. A pet's kill counts for its master. items: count of random armor/weapons, tier picked from item_tiers, legendary_pct turns one into tier 1. components: rare mining finds (utils/mining rare band); cut/flawless: Path stones. Elite: drop_pct x the ordinary weapon chance, recipe_mult x the ordinary recipe chance, scroll/component rolls inside the ordinary once-per-hour gate. Percent and counts are integers (Fenia has no floats)."
